    <div class="container">
        <!-- HERO -->
        <section class="hero">
            <div class="hero-tags">Phylum Cnidaria · Class Hydrozoa · Lower Toarcian · ~183 Ma</div>
            <h1>Hydrozoan Microfossils from the <em>Toarcian Oceanic Anoxic Event</em></h1>
            <p>Morphology, taxonomy, and paleoenvironmental significance of organic-walled hydrozoan microfossils discovered at T-OAE levels in the Bächental Basin, Austrian Alps. Correlation with Tethyan basin records and implications for reconstructing Early Jurassic ocean anoxia.</p>
            
            <div class="stats-grid">
                <div class="stat-item">
                    <h3>~183</h3>
                    <p>Ma — Age</p>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-item">
