                    <p style="font-size: 0.9rem;">Bächental Basin, NW Tethys margin</p>
                </div>
                <div class="card">
                    <p class="teal" style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size:0.8rem; margin-bottom:0.5rem">LITHOLOGY</p>
                    <h3 class="teal" style="margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Bituminous Marls</h3>
                    <p style="font-size: 0.9rem;">Bächentaler Bitumenmergel, Sachrang Mbr.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="card">
