                    <p style="font-size: 0.9rem;">Organic-rich black shale facies</p>
                </div>
                <div class="card">
                    <p class="teal" style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size:0.8rem; margin-bottom:0.5rem">TRIGGER</p>
