                    <h3 class="orange" style="margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Suboxic–Euxinic</h3>
                    <p style="font-size: 0.9rem;">Stratified water column, H₂S bottom waters</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <h3 style="margin-top: 4rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Carbon Isotope Excursion (CIE) Across the T-OAE</h3>
            <p style="font-size:0.9rem;">Schematic δ¹³C profile illustrating the negative carbon isotope excursion characteristic of the T-OAE.</p>
